    "text": "Herald And Journal\nwebsite\nPlato\nPlato Defeats Green Isle in 8 innings\nBy Oray Tangen, Sports Write,10 hours ago\nPLATO – The Plato Blue Jays moved back to .500 in CRVL play with a thorough dispatching of the Green Isle Irish on Friday, June 20. Blue Jay center fielder Tate Wischnack continued his hot streak at the plate, with two extra-base hits and four RBI. Teammate Dayton Franke was a perfect 3 for 3 with a home run and four RBI.\nComments\nLoading editor...",
